   <owl:Class rdf:ID="ndb_struct_na_base_pair_step">
      <rdfs:label>ndb_struct_na_base_pair_step</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
Data items in the NDB_STRUCT_NA_BASE_PAIR_STEP category record details
