      <rdfs:label>pdbx_chem_comp_atom_coordination.geometry_abbr</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
This data item lists the abbreviated name of the geometry, as specified in the
attribute descriptor in category pdbx_chem_comp_atom_coordination_sphere. For instance, square planar
 is abbreviated to SPL. The geometry derived from observed geometries in atomic coordinate files.
                        </rdfs:comment>
