      <rdfs:label>pdbx_chem_comp_atom_coordination_sphere.geometry_id</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
This data item is a foreign key to attribute geometry_id in category pdbx_chem_comp_atom_coordination. This item maps the
 coordination descriptor to a specific geometry described in the pdbx_chem_comp_atom_coordination category.
                        </rdfs:comment>
