   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_chem_comp_identifier.program">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_chem_comp_identifierItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_chem_comp_identifier.program</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
This data item contains the name of the program
or library used to compute the identifier.
OpenEye OECHEM program
OPENEYE
Daylight program library
DAYLIGHT
Advanced Chemistry Development Naming Program
ACD
Belstein AutoNom Naming Program
AUTONOM
Compound  identifier
PUBCHEM_CID
Substance identifier
PUBCHEM_SID
Other program or library
OTHER
Non-programmatic identifier
NONE
                     </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_chem_comp_identifier.program_version">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_chem_comp_identifierItem"/>
