      <rdfs:label>pdbx_chem_comp_synonyms</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
PDBX_CHEM_COMP_SYNONYMS holds chemical name and synonym correspondences.

    Example 1 -
&lt;PDBx:pdbx_chem_comp_synonymsCategory&gt;
