   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_dcc_density.I_over_sigI_diff">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_dcc_densityItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_dcc_density.I_over_sigI_diff</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The difference of the &lt;I/SigmaI&gt; in the last two points of the
