      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_dcc_density.twin_by_xtriage</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
Boolean (Y/N) whether twin is detected by Xtriage.
