   <owl:Class rdf:ID="pdbx_entity_instance_feature">
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_entity_instance_feature</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
Data items in the pdbx_entity_instance_feature category records
special features of selected entity instances.

    Example 1 -
&lt;PDBx:pdbx_entity_instance_featureCategory&gt;
