   <owl:Class rdf:ID="pdbx_investigation">
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_investigation</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The PDBX_INVESTIGATION category provides a information of an investigation associated with this file.

    Example 1
&lt;PDBx:pdbx_investigationCategory&gt;
