   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_linked_entity_link_list.entity_id_1">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_linked_entity_link_listItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_linked_entity_link_list.entity_id_1</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The entity id of the first of the two entities joined by the
linkage.

This data item is a pointer to attribute entity_id
 in category pdbx_linked_entity_list in the PDBX_LINKED_ENTITY_LIST category.
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_linked_entity_link_list.entity_id_2">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_linked_entity_link_listItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_linked_entity_link_list.entity_id_2</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The entity id of the second of the two entities joined by the
linkage.

This data item is a pointer to attribute entity_id
 in category pdbx_linked_entity_list in the PDBX_LINKED_ENTITY_LIST category.
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_linked_entity_link_list.entity_seq_num_1">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_linked_entity_link_listItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_linked_entity_link_list.entity_seq_num_1</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
For a polymer entity, the sequence number in the first of
the two entities containing the linkage.

This data item is a pointer to attribute num
 in category entity_poly_seq in the ENTITY_POLY_SEQ category.
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_linked_entity_link_list.entity_seq_num_2">
