   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference.carbon_shifts_flag">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_referenceItem"/>
      <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference"/>
      <rdfs:range>
         <owl:DataRange>
            <owl:oneOf>
               <rdf:List>
                  <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">no</rdf:first>
                  <rdf:rest>
                     <rdf:List>
                        <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">yes</rdf:first>
                        <rdf:rest>
                           <rdf:List>
                              <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">yes with IUPAC referencing</rdf:first>
                              <rdf:rest rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil"/>
                           </rdf:List>
                        </rdf:rest>
                     </rdf:List>
                  </rdf:rest>
               </rdf:List>
            </owl:oneOf>
         </owl:DataRange>
      </rdfs:range>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

A value indicating if 13C chemical shifts are being deposited and if IUPAC chemical shift referencing was used. This item
is a user interface item that is used to trigger the automated population of chemical shift referencing tags if IUPAC
chemical shift referencing parameters have been used.
yes with IUPAC referencing
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference.details">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_referenceItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference.details</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Text providing additional information regarding the reported chemical shift
referencing values or methods.
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference.label">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_referenceItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference.label</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

A descriptive label that uniquely identifies this list of chemical shift
referencing parameters used in reporting assigned chemical shifts and other chemical
shift data.
chemical_shift_reference_1
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference.nitrogen_shifts_flag">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_referenceItem"/>
      <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference"/>
      <rdfs:range>
         <owl:DataRange>
            <owl:oneOf>
               <rdf:List>
                  <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">no</rdf:first>
                  <rdf:rest>
                     <rdf:List>
                        <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">yes</rdf:first>
                        <rdf:rest>
                           <rdf:List>
                              <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">yes with IUPAC referencing</rdf:first>
                              <rdf:rest rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil"/>
                           </rdf:List>
                        </rdf:rest>
                     </rdf:List>
                  </rdf:rest>
               </rdf:List>
            </owl:oneOf>
         </owl:DataRange>
      </rdfs:range>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

A value indicating if 15N chemical shifts are being deposited and if IUPAC chemical shift referencing was used. This item
is a user interface item that is used to trigger the automated population of chemical shift referencing tags if IUPAC
chemical shift referencing parameters have been used.
yes
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference.other_shifts_flag">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_referenceItem"/>
      <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference"/>
      <rdfs:range>
         <owl:DataRange>
            <owl:oneOf>
               <rdf:List>
                  <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">no</rdf:first>
                  <rdf:rest>
                     <rdf:List>
                        <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">yes</rdf:first>
                        <rdf:rest rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil"/>
                     </rdf:List>
                  </rdf:rest>
               </rdf:List>
            </owl:oneOf>
         </owl:DataRange>
      </rdfs:range>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

A value indicating if chemical shifts other than 1H, 13C, 15N, or 31P are being deposited.
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference.phosphorus_shifts_flag">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_referenceItem"/>
      <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference"/>
      <rdfs:range>
         <owl:DataRange>
            <owl:oneOf>
               <rdf:List>
                  <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">no</rdf:first>
                  <rdf:rest>
                     <rdf:List>
                        <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">yes</rdf:first>
                        <rdf:rest>
                           <rdf:List>
                              <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">yes with IUPAC referencing</rdf:first>
                              <rdf:rest rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil"/>
                           </rdf:List>
                        </rdf:rest>
                     </rdf:List>
                  </rdf:rest>
               </rdf:List>
            </owl:oneOf>
         </owl:DataRange>
      </rdfs:range>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

A value indicating if 31P chemical shifts are being deposited and if IUPAC chemical shift referencing was used. This item
is a user interface item that is used to trigger the automated population of chemical shift referencing tags if IUPAC
chemical shift referencing parameters have been used.
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference.proton_shifts_flag">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_referenceItem"/>
      <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference"/>
      <rdfs:range>
         <owl:DataRange>
            <owl:oneOf>
               <rdf:List>
                  <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">no</rdf:first>
                  <rdf:rest>
                     <rdf:List>
                        <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">yes</rdf:first>
                        <rdf:rest>
                           <rdf:List>
                              <rdf:first rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">yes with IUPAC referencing</rdf:first>
                              <rdf:rest rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil"/>
                           </rdf:List>
                        </rdf:rest>
                     </rdf:List>
                  </rdf:rest>
               </rdf:List>
            </owl:oneOf>
         </owl:DataRange>
      </rdfs:range>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

A value indicating if 1H chemical shifts are being deposited and if IUPAC chemical shift referencing was used. This item
is a user interface item that is used to trigger the automated population of chemical shift referencing tags if IUPAC
chemical shift referencing parameters have been used.
Please indicate yes or no$ if you are depositing 1H chemical shifts.
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference.entry_id">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_referenceItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference.entry_id</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Pointer to '_entry.id'
2SNS
                     </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_nmr_chem_shift_reference.id">
