   <owl:Class rdf:ID="pdbx_nmr_details">
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_nmr_details</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

Experimental details of the NMR study that have not been
described elsewhere in this deposition.

         </rdfs:comment>
