   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_nmr_exptl_sample_conditions.details">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_exptl_sample_conditionsItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_nmr_exptl_sample_conditions.details</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">

General details describing conditions of both the sample and the environment
during measurements.

The high salinity of the sample may have contributed to overheating of the sample during experiments with long saturation periods like the TOCSY experiments.
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_nmr_exptl_sample_conditions.ionic_strength">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_nmr_exptl_sample_conditionsItem"/>
