   <owl:Class rdf:ID="pdbx_nonpoly_atom_coordination_sphere_order">
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_nonpoly_atom_coordination_sphere_order</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
This category describes the order of the atoms in the
coordination sphere category:
pdbx_nonpoly_atom_coordination_sphere. The order of the
atoms is the encoding of the 3D arrangement of atoms
for a particular coordination geometry.

    Example 1 - based on 1RPT
&lt;PDBx:pdbx_nonpoly_atom_coordination_sphere_orderCategory&gt;
   &lt;PDBx:pdbx_nonpoly_atom_coordination_sphere_order atom_place="1" label_atom_id="NE2" label_comp_id="HIS" sphere_id="1"&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:auth_asym_id&gt;A&lt;/PDBx:auth_asym_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:auth_atom_id&gt;NE2&lt;/PDBx:auth_atom_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:auth_comp_id&gt;HIS&lt;/PDBx:auth_comp_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:auth_seq_id&gt;12&lt;/PDBx:auth_seq_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:label_asym_id&gt;A&lt;/PDBx:label_asym_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:label_seq_id&gt;12&lt;/PDBx:label_seq_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:symmetry_operation&gt;x,y,z&lt;/PDBx:symmetry_operation&gt;
   &lt;/PDBx:pdbx_nonpoly_atom_coordination_sphere_order&gt;
   &lt;PDBx:pdbx_nonpoly_atom_coordination_sphere_order atom_place="2" label_atom_id="O1" label_comp_id="VO4" sphere_id="1"&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:auth_asym_id&gt;A&lt;/PDBx:auth_asym_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:auth_atom_id&gt;O1&lt;/PDBx:auth_atom_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:auth_comp_id&gt;VO4&lt;/PDBx:auth_comp_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:auth_seq_id&gt;343&lt;/PDBx:auth_seq_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:label_asym_id&gt;D&lt;/PDBx:label_asym_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:label_seq_id xsi:nil="true" /&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:symmetry_operation&gt;x,y,z&lt;/PDBx:symmetry_operation&gt;
   &lt;/PDBx:pdbx_nonpoly_atom_coordination_sphere_order&gt;
   &lt;PDBx:pdbx_nonpoly_atom_coordination_sphere_order atom_place="3" label_atom_id="O2" label_comp_id="VO4" sphere_id="1"&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:auth_asym_id&gt;A&lt;/PDBx:auth_asym_id&gt;
