      <rdfs:label>pdbx_nonpoly_atom_feature</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
Data items in the PDBX_NONPOLY_ATOM_FEATURE category provide
a selected list of atom level features for the chemical component.

    Example 1 - based on 1RPT
&lt;PDBx:pdbx_nonpoly_atom_featureCategory&gt;
   &lt;PDBx:pdbx_nonpoly_atom_feature ordinal="1"&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:auth_asym_id&gt;A&lt;/PDBx:auth_asym_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:auth_atom_id&gt;V&lt;/PDBx:auth_atom_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:auth_comp_id&gt;VO4&lt;/PDBx:auth_comp_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:auth_seq_id&gt;343&lt;/PDBx:auth_seq_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:label_asym_id&gt;D&lt;/PDBx:label_asym_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:label_atom_id&gt;V&lt;/PDBx:label_atom_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:label_comp_id&gt;VO4&lt;/PDBx:label_comp_id&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:label_seq_id xsi:nil="true" /&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:provenance&gt;Author&lt;/PDBx:provenance&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:type&gt;Oxidation state&lt;/PDBx:type&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:value&gt;5&lt;/PDBx:value&gt;
   &lt;/PDBx:pdbx_nonpoly_atom_feature&gt;
&lt;/PDBx:pdbx_nonpoly_atom_featureCategory&gt;


