contact.

This data item is a pointer to attribute atom_id in category chem_comp_atom in the
 CHEM_COMP_ATOM category.
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_val_sym_contact.label_atom_id_2">
