                     </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_virtual_bond.site_symmetry_1">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_virtual_bondItem"/>
      <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
      <rdfs:label>pdbx_virtual_bond.site_symmetry_1</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
The symmetry code of the first of the two atom sites that
define the bond specified by attribute dist in category pdbx_virtual_bond. 
4th symmetry operation applied
4
7th symm. posn.; +a on x; -b on y
7_645
                     </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
   <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:ID="pdbx_virtual_bond.site_symmetry_2">
      <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="#pdbx_virtual_bondItem"/>
