      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
Keywords describing this structure.  This is constructed by the
PROGRAM for the PDB KEYWRD record.
B-DNA, DOUBLE HELIX, MODIFIED
B-DNA, DOUBLE HELIX, FLIPPED OUT BASES
                        </rdfs:comment>
