      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
Terms characterizing the macromolecular structure.
DNA
RNA
T-RNA
DNA/RNA
RIBOZYME
PROTEIN/DNA
PROTEIN/RNA
PEPTIDE NUCLEIC ACID
PEPTIDE NUCLEIC ACID/DNA
DNA-BINDING PROTEIN
RNA-BINDING PROTEIN
                        </rdfs:comment>
   </owl:DatatypeProperty>
