   <owl:Class rdf:ID="struct_ncs_ensCategory">
      <rdfs:subClassOf>
         <owl:Class>
            <owl:intersectionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
               <owl:Class rdf:about="#Category"/>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#has_struct_ncs_ens"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
            </owl:intersectionOf>
         </owl:Class>
      </rdfs:subClassOf>
   </owl:Class>
   <owl:Class rdf:ID="struct_ncs_ens">
      <rdfs:label>struct_ncs_ens</rdfs:label>
      <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">
Data items in the STRUCT_NCS_ENS category record information
about ensembles of domains related by noncrystallographic
symmetry. The point group of the ensemble when taken as a
whole may be specified, as well as any special aspects of the
ensemble that require description.

    Example 1 - based on laboratory records for the collagen-like
                peptide, HYP-.
&lt;PDBx:struct_ncs_ensCategory&gt;
   &lt;PDBx:struct_ncs_ens id="en1"&gt;
      &lt;PDBx:details&gt; The ensemble represents the pseudo-twofold symmetry
between domains d1 and d2.&lt;/PDBx:details&gt;
   &lt;/PDBx:struct_ncs_ens&gt;
&lt;/PDBx:struct_ncs_ensCategory&gt;


         </rdfs:comment>
      <rdfs:subClassOf>
         <owl:Class>
            <owl:intersectionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
               <owl:Class rdf:about="#CategoryElement"/>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#struct_ncs_ens.details"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#struct_ncs_ens.details"/>
                  <owl:maxCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#struct_ncs_ens.point_group"/>
                  <owl:minCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">0</owl:minCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#struct_ncs_ens.point_group"/>
                  <owl:maxCardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:maxCardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
               <owl:Restriction>
                  <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="#struct_ncs_ens.id"/>
                  <owl:cardinality rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#nonNegativeInteger">1</owl:cardinality>
               </owl:Restriction>
            </owl:intersectionOf>
         </owl:Class>
      </rdfs:subClassOf>
   </owl:Class>
   <owl:InverseFunctionalProperty rdf:ID="has_struct_ncs_ensCategory">
      <rdfs:label>struct_ncs_ensCategory</rdfs:label>
